== Trivia ==
* "Ghost pepper" is an alternate name for the [[wikipedia:Bhut jolokia|bhut jolokia]], which is arguably one of the world's hottest peppers.
* {{dlc+|r}}After ''Repentance'', this item is essentially a {{i|The Candle}} variant of {{i|Bird's Eye}}. It was likely reworked instead of the new item since the "ghost" thematic fits blue fires better.{{dlc-}}

